{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730200/extras/demo_features.png?t=1747930636\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730200/extras/engage.png?t=1747930636\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Armed with Verruna, your sentient blade, unleash a mix of hacks, slashes and fiery power to cut through anything standing in your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get a thrilling taste of the tight, polished combat at the heart of <i>Fall of Gorithia: Nym's Fate</i>. Face off against the nightmarish Vorid \u2014 eldritch mutants spreading through the crumbling kingdom \u2014 clash with the enigmatic Sentinels lurking in the forsaken depths and adapt your powers to conquer your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730200/extras/ezgif.com-effects.gif?t=1747930636\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore the beginning of an epic journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Begin Nym\u2019s journey in this limited demo and uncover the early echoes of a much larger saga. Venture into the haunted tunnels of Southpass, battle the twisted Vorid in the corrupted forests of Myrwood, and honor ancient legends within the sacred halls of the Watcher Temple.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Challenge your enviroments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world of Gorithia isn\u2019t just dangerous\u2014it\u2019s demanding. Leap across collapsing platforms, dash past deadly traps, and slide through narrow passages in challenging platforming challenges. Your reflexes and persistence will be rewarded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730200/extras/customize.png?t=1747930636\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sample a portion of the deep customization system. Discover rings, necklaces, and magical shards scattered throughout the land\u2014each one enhancing your abilities. Choose between empowering your swordplay or embracing the power of magic as your main weapon of choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Meet the Survivors of a Fallen Kingdom</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet a few of the hardy souls who\u2019ve endured the fall. Help them rebuild, complete quests, trade for unique items, and earn powerful rewards\u2014all hinting at the rich world and relationships that await in the full adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730200/extras/journey.png?t=1747930636\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Through mysterious timegates, glimpse fragments of the kingdom\u2019s forgotten history. Witness echoes of legendary battles, meet heroes long gone, and challenge the ancient foes who once shaped the fate of Gorithia.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3730200?t=1747930636","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3730200?t=1747930636","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730200/a8cba615257260c034f50066ac661ae331a87bc7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747930636","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730200/a8cba615257260c034f50066ac661ae331a87bc7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747930636","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/