oughout the land\u2014each one enhancing your abilities. Choose between empowering your swordplay or embracing the power of magic as your main weapon of choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Meet the Survivors of a Fallen Kingdom</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet a few of the hardy souls who\u2019ve endured the fall. Help them rebuild, complete quests, trade for unique items, and earn powerful rewards\u2014all hinting at the rich world and relationships that await in the full adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730200/extras/journey.png?t=1747930636\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Through mysterious timegates, glimpse fragments of the kingdom\u2019s forgotten history. Witness echoes of legendary battles, meet heroes long gone, and challenge the ancient foes who once shaped the fate of Gorithia.</p>","developers":["Myrwood Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3059800","name":"Fall of Gorithia: Nym's Fate"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730200/9263808f16c022a8a498d56d4927ebf68577a8ef/header.jpg?t=1747930636","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257139339,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257139339/movie480.mp4?t=1747328433","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257139339/movie_max.mp4?t=1747328433"},"name":"Fall of Gorithia: Nym's Fate | Demo Trailer","t